{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7993","id":5220086182,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNyQxpg","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7993","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7993.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7993.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7993","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7993/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7993/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7993/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/3161e19fc846beff631c104381d1f887578a4683","number":7993,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(id): tooltip-mode, pin and minimize state machine for cursors (#1790 slice 1)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Slice 1 of 3 for #1790 (per the split suggested on the issue's verified park notes): the pure state machine in `pkgs/id/web/src/cursor-utils.ts`, with tests. This PR does **not** close #1790 — slices 2 (cursors.ts wiring + UI toggle) and 3 (client/server lifecycle logging + liveness-based fade) remain on task 14115.\n\n## What lands\n- `TooltipMode` (`full` / `minimal` / `hidden`) + `nextTooltipMode` toggle cycle.\n- `resolveTooltipDisplay` — precedence oracle is the #1790 text: hidden mode hides unpinned cursors (pinned exempt), an explicit per-cursor minimize hides in any mode, the click-to-enlarge chain overrides the resting display, minimal mode shows the tooltip only at hover >= 1s (`HOVER_TOOLTIP_DELAY_MS`), full mode shows the tooltip.\n- Click-to-enlarge revert chain: `getEnlargeStage` — big -> tooltip -> minimal, one 1s step each (`ENLARGE_STEP_MS`); clock skew reads as just-enlarged.\n- Per-cursor display state: immutable `setCursorPinned` / `setCursorMinimized` map updates and `partitionCursorsByMinimized` producing the visible set and the minimize/restore list.\n\n## Tests (oracle: #1790 settled scope text)\n- New `pkgs/id/web/src/cursor-tooltip-state.test.ts`: 20 tests — mode cycle, enlarge-stage boundaries (0 / 999 / 1000 / 1999 / 2000 ms, skew), hover threshold boundary (999 / 1000 ms), pinned exemption, minimize precedence, partition order.\n- `bunx vitest run src/cursor-tooltip-state.test.ts src/cursor-utils.test.ts` — 98 passed. `bunx tsc --noEmit` — clean.\n- Full web suite: 705 passed, 1 failed — `search-panel.test.ts` aria-label expectation, verified pre-existing on clean `main` (same failure with this change stashed); unrelated to cursors.\n\n## Liveness note (acceptance item, documented per #1790)\nVerified by prior lanes and carried here: fade age is currently `now - lastUpdate`, and `lastUpdate` refreshes on cursor *position* updates, not on websocket pong/activity — inactivity is NOT yet liveness-based. Fixing that is slice 3 scope (with the lifecycle logging), not this PR.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796799992&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7993&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7993&signature=d36d243ae3ce0514d8c52254432c020176c422bc83b7e7ad74a95eee4d499aa9\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7993?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Cursor tooltip display now supports full, minimal, and hidden modes, with hover-based timing and staged cursor enlargement.\n  * Cursors can be pinned to keep them visible or explicitly minimized.\n* **Tests**\n  * Added coverage for tooltip timing and modes, pinning and minimization, and cursor ordering.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T07:06:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T08:47:36Z","closed_at":"2026-11-09T08:47:33Z","merged_at":"2026-11-09T08:47:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"b957ba64f93718d7dd72d148c5d80e06f09f3be5","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"reques